            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "DefaultExecution – co se stane při spuštění shelly bez parametrů: UpgradeAll, UpgradeStandard, UpgradeFlatpak, UpgradeAur, Sync, SyncForce, ListInstalled",
          "formatting": [
